  "question": {
    "text": "The distance of the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> from the plane <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> measured along the straight line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of line parallel to the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math> and passing through (1, 2, 3) is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Coordinates of a general point on this line is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> .<br />It meets the given plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />So, the point of intersection is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, distance <math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
  }
